                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I kare ma doŋ waneno ni pe waromo ciro wacel, wamito ni wadoŋ woko cen kenwa i Atene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci waoro botwu Temceo, ma en ominwa ki latic pa Lubaŋa i tito lok me kwena maber i kom Kricito, wek ojiŋ cwinywu obed tek dok odi cwinywu i kom niyewu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wek can magi pe oryaŋ kom dano mo. Wun kikomwu wuŋeyo ni can ma kit meno myero opot i komwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien i kare ma pud watye kacel kwedwu watittiwu con ni, i kare mo i anyim wabineno can, ma doŋ bene otimme woko kit macalo wuŋeyo-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi lok man,, ka doŋ anoŋo ni pe aromo diyo cwinya, aoro dano botwu wek aniaŋ i kom niyewu, ka ce labit dano doŋ obitowu woko, nyo ticwa ma watiyo bene doŋo olal nono. p ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 18.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ento kombeddi Temceo doŋ odwogo botwa kun oa ki botwu. En okelo botwa lok mamit i kom niyewu ki mar ma wutye kwede, dok bene ni wupo piwa jwijwi ki kica madwoŋ kun wuparo pi nenowa mada macalo wan bene waparo me nenowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utmegiwa, meno aye gin mumiyo cwinywa okwe i komwu pi niyewu, i can ki i un ma giunowa kwede ducu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kombeddi doŋ wabedo kwo ka wacuŋ matek i Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit pwoc aŋo muporre ma waromo miyo bot Lubaŋa piwu, ki pi yomcwiny ducu ma wumiyowa ma miyo cwinywa bedo yom i nyim Lubaŋa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I dyeceŋ ki dyewor walego Lubaŋa matek twatwal pi nenowu waŋ ki waŋ, wek wamed botwu gin murem i kom niyewu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubaŋa Wonwa kikome, ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, myero omi wanoŋ yo me bino botwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok walego Rwot omiwu wumedde matek twatwal i mar, kun ŋat acel acel maro lawote ki jo ducu, i kit ma wan wamarowu kwede, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wek en ojiŋ cwinywu obed tek dok wubed jo maleŋ laboŋo lok mo ma loyowa i nyim Lubaŋa Wonwa, i kare me dwogo pa Rwotwa Yecu ki jone maleŋ ducu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
